  "statement": "For the hash-pinned A1 production coefficients and A10-A13 strict sharp cubes, all prior A13 reductions remain binding at T4. R-075 proves an exact projector-free invariant-current Taylor chart, closes the principal unshifted C^(-1/2-kappa) one-form with a cutoff-uniform sixth moment, and proves predictable Cameron--Martin/terminal-L6 graph recovery at each fixed cutoff. The chart is algebraically global but rank-degenerate at a pure-singlet tip; the principal tensor is not Ward-complete. Exact horizontal, constant-control, and Hermite fixtures prove that the third-order coefficient-transport tail survives, its termwise absolute payment is Young-critical, a one-form-only endpoint omits a load-bearing Wick channel, and a smooth adapted counterexample shows that arbitrary adapted substitution need not preserve a finite R-063 chaos forest. The signed coefficient-transport endpoint remainder, controlled-shell one-use, and the q=10/9 Nelson theorem remain open.",
